.TH FAZ-AGORA 1 "September 2026" "faz-agora 2.3.11" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
faz-agora \- task manager with optional WebDAV synchronization
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B faz-agora
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Faz agora!
is a desktop task manager for creating tasks, subtasks, reminders, and
recurrences. It works offline and can optionally synchronize tasks through a
WebDAV folder chosen by the user.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.willdo/config.json
Local application configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
Project documentation at https://github.com/willf444/faz-agora
.SH AUTHOR
